# Keep the image small and free of secrets. The app's source stays in: the
# image's web stage exports the web app from it.
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/coverage
**/dist
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
apps/mobile/e2e
apps/mobile/test-results
apps/mobile/playwright-report
.git
.github
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
docs
infra
*.md
# Render copies a service's secret files into the root of the build context,
# so `COPY . .` would put them in the image. List each one here; the build's
# secret mounts still get them (runbook, "Error reports and uptime").
sentry-auth-token
